      "title": "Amid Nvidia controversy, Megaspeed says Alice Huang left firm in Aug 2025",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/amid-nvidia-controversy-megaspeed-says-alice-huang-left-firm-in-aug-2025-126111600072_1.html",
      "description": "Megaspeed is ‌an Nvidia business partner and has been ​in spotlight after reports that Jensen Huang had an affair ​with its former exec Alice Huang, whom US authorities suspect of being a Chinese spy",
